#, php-format
msgid "No account yet? See %s."
msgstr "Još nemate račun? Pogledajte %s."

msgid "Try it with the demo account"
msgstr "Isprobajte s demo računom"

msgid "The public Kigo.Cloud demo account shows the whole flow before you have your own account: the order becomes an invoice with a ZKI and a JIR, signed with a test certificate, so it is not a real fiscalized invoice."
msgstr "Javni demo račun Kigo.Clouda pokazuje cijeli tijek prije nego otvorite svoj račun: narudžba postaje račun sa ZKI-jem i JIR-om, potpisan testnim certifikatom, pa to nije pravi fiskalizirani račun."

msgid "Anyone can log in to the demo account, so everything sent there, including the name, address and e-mail of the customer, is visible to others. Use it only with test orders and switch to your own account before taking real orders."
msgstr "U demo račun može se prijaviti bilo tko, pa je sve što se onamo pošalje, uključujući ime, adresu i e-poštu kupca, vidljivo drugima. Koristite ga samo s probnim narudžbama i prijeđite na svoj račun prije pravih narudžbi."

msgid "Try with the demo account"
msgstr "Isprobaj s demo računom"

msgid "Demo login filled in. Click Save all settings to use it."
msgstr "Demo prijava je upisana. Kliknite Spremi sve postavke da je upotrijebite."

#, php-format
msgid "The documents can be seen in the demo at %s (username and password admin_demo)."
msgstr "Dokumente možete vidjeti u demu na %s (korisničko ime i lozinka admin_demo)."

msgid "Enter the API key, or the API username and password, on the Connection tab and save them first."
msgstr "Najprije upišite API ključ, ili API korisničko ime i lozinku, na kartici Veza i spremite ih."

msgid "The price list could not be saved in the uploads folder."
msgstr "Cjenik nije moguće spremiti u mapu uploads."

